  minQuality: 1
  requestLines:
  - Now then, darling, I have a little something to ask of you.
  - 'I would simply adore a sunflower painting for my collection. A proper one, mind:
    Good quality or better.'
  - Bring it to me when it is ready, and I shall be waiting with bated breath.
  thanksLines:
  - Oh, it is magnificent! Look at those petals, they practically hum. This will
    be the very first jewel of my collection.
  - Mark my words, I shall have more requests for you soon. A collector's appetite
    is never satisfied!
  rewardCoins: 40
  rewardXp: 30
